      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Reclaim Energy were very informative regarding the whole process, even to the point of having their Engineer speak to me on several occasions to answer a few questions about some components of the system that I had and the suitable options available. I asked for the best middle of the road equipment as the top quality parts would push the price out of my budget and that is what was installed. We also added Solar Analytics and a timer for heat the hot water system during the productive period of the day.We installed 24 panels with 2 x 5KW inverters, this gives us 2 separate 5 KW systems operating independently of each other.The work was done with no problems at all, the guys were very professional and did an extremely neat job.Highly recommend Reclaim Solar Energy!",
